.TH sway-things-hook-waybar 1 "" "Sway Things 0.6.0" "Sway Things Manual"
.SH NAME
sway\-things\-hook\-waybar \- Write the config and stylesheet of Sway Things for waybar and start waybar with them, unless one runs already or your sway config starts it: run at every start and reload of sway while waybar is the bar
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsway\-things hook waybar\fR [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Write the config and stylesheet of Sway Things for waybar and start waybar with them, unless one runs already or your sway config starts it: run at every start and reload of sway while waybar is the bar
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR [default: auto]
Controls when to use color
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
